p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-kBrpAN7g\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-jn8MEVru\">人群包来源， 详见<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710761459712#custom-anchor-%E4%BA%BA%E7%BE%A4%E5%8C%85%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">【附录-DMP相关-人群包来源】</a></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-T3DIyJb3\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-AmQmGHvs\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-wrS6xRdF\"><span class=\"qz-table-level qz-table-level-2\" data-level=\"2\" data-type=\"level\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22level%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22F6ptw%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\"> </span>status</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-p4ug71CB\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Jezm9Jvm\">number</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-MciRGSLn\"><br/></p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-zOyyIt6p\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-eReIrxyo\">人群包状态，详见<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710761459712#custom-anchor-%E4%BA%BA%E7%BE%A4%E5%8C%85%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">【附录-DMP相关-人群包状态】</a></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-iHJqdT82\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-JzZRalPM\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-YlDbrrnO\"><span class=\"qz-table-level qz-table-level-2\" data-level=\"2\" data-type=\"level\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22level%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22Dv1wk%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\"> </span>cover_num</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-HcKy89hR\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-9mPIWNOI\">number</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-TmOdxzmr\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-DX9aqeq7\">人群包覆盖人群数目，基于<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">\"upload_num\"</code>：上传数据源包含的人群数目与uid对应后，再与头条系产品MAU交集后的数量（存在一个设备号/手机号对应多个uid的情况）<br/>实际数量可能多于/少于<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">\"upload_num\"</code>：上传数据源包含的人群数目</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-bp1WVXni\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-Q4LxUM02\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-KcXA3XE3\"><span class=\"qz-table-level qz-table-level-2\" data-level=\"2\" data-type=\"level\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22level%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22s9iTr%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\"> </span>upload_num</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-CTEathqz\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-RV1xCvIo\">number</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-jcs7sD1h\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ynXudaQD\">上传数据源包含的人群数目</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-AnnXUFOH\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-kGDomYpU\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-jGrDbpHi\"><span class=\"qz-table-level qz-table-level-2\" data-level=\"2\" data-type=\"level\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22level%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22YZaoF%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\"> </span>tag</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-SSnROaUa\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-EJDatirj\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-1ZWAHsL0\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-9K2wHEh9\">人群包标签</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-fbr5YSYn\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-AIe0vi4G\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-cnLyO7Sg\"><span class=\"qz-table-level qz-table-level-2\" data-level=\"2\" data-type=\"level\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22level%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22YGf09%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\"> </span>push_status</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-svehKWyg\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-iYzxcIdT\">number</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-R3dGu4we\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-KoSS6Yj5\">推送状态，详见<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710761459712#custom-anchor-DMP%E6%8E%A8%E9%80%81%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%EF%BC%88opt_status%EF%BC%89\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">【附录-DMP相关-DMP推送状态】</a></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-DdGxrmDv\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-fvxhl06L\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-MfelFLNN\"><span class=\"qz-table-level qz-table-level-2\" data-level=\"2\" data-type=\"level\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22level%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22YsLGy%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\"> </span>delivery_status</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-NAf63ioy\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-MCyfyqFR\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-i775Mc3V\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-t5fB9lTe\">人群包可投放状态，只有当状态为<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">CUSTOM_AUDIENCE_DELIVERY_STATUS_AVAILABLE</code>时才可进行投放使用<br/><strong>可选值：</strong><br/><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">CUSTOM_AUDIENCE_DELIVERY_STATUS_AVAILABLE</code>：可投放，人群包发布完成且推送完成<br/><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">CUSTOM_AUDIENCE_DELIVERY_STATUS_NEED_PUSH</code>：不可投放，人群包发布完成，但未推送，需要进行推送后再使用<br/><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">CUSTOM_AUDIENCE_DELIVERY_STATUS_NEED_PUBLISH</code>：不可投放，群包未发布但已推送，需要进行发布后再使用<br/><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">CUSTOM_AUDIENCE_DELIVERY_STATUS_UNAVAILABLE</code>：不可投放，未发布完成且未推送</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-NKQqRqvV\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-yiurtQQe\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-AlYDuiI6\"><span class=\"qz-table-level qz-table-level-2\" data-level=\"2\" data-type=\"level\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22level%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22XnjXM%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\"> </span>create_time</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-TMYteAyl\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-svngmoO2\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-2izSZjJV\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-bfLxgkED\">人群包创建时间</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-ASCtY1SP\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-40F5hacL\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-dN0W22pM\"><span class=\"qz-table-level qz-table-level-2\" data-level=\"2\" data-type=\"level\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22level%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22c16B7%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\"> </span>modify_time</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-X5YVUWGB\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-5LXxhdus\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-DQg770AL\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-xFL7gcn1\">人群包修改时间</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-288eYxf8\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-Umqb7o2t\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-F9EW7PXo\"><span class=\"qz-table-level qz-table-level-2\" data-level=\"2\" data-type=\"level\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22level%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22dfaO0%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\"> </span>third_party_info</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-6kZ273ld\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-wTMVBVHN\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-iLWtezZ8\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-v1Igh7Mn\">是否为三方包，均返回<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">“非三方包”</code></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-FgDw2Px8\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-J00cRBLQ\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-SxhRbX5d\"><span class=\"qz-table-level qz-table-level-2\" data-level=\"2\" data-type=\"level\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22level%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZkrTm%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\"> </span>exist_pull_off_tag</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-0YIB4rs6\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-cWtdOr5g\">number</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-egJuVSZ0\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Dhj68xfG\">人群包是否包含下线标签，<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">0</code>：不包含，<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">1</code>：包含</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-cSwK9sQY\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-CJj2HC4e\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-F7KP8F76\">request_id</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-73keOEqM\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-S39w42bY\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tb7d4c2b-ZZi3edVA\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-c1TN9LiO\">请求日志id</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-WPBY9GHp\" id=\"link-6\">应答示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22json%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%7B%5Cn%20%20%5C%22message%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22OK%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%5C%22code%5C%22%3A%200%2C%5Cn%20%20%5C%22data%5C%22%3A%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22custom_audience_list%5C%22%3A%20%5B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22status%5C%22%3A%2013%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22name%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22custom_audience_id%5C%22%3A%200%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22cover_num%5C%22%3A%2